  "title": {
   "en": "Inuta-san"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "犬田さん"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Sitting next to me is the cutest girl in class. And she’s totally like a dog, inside and out—Inuta-san! She says hi in the cutest way, we eat lunch together, walk to and from school together… Inuta-san is so adorable, school has never been this fun!\n\nIf there were a cute puppy in your class, every day would be way more fun! A cute school life dog comedy!"
  },
